\hich\af37\dbch\af13\loch\f37 Hendrik\cell \hich\af37\dbch\af13\loch\f37 I have fond memories of Puerto Valor. I spent time here as a young man, being trained by Don Rodrigo in the art of swordsmanship.
\par 
